TITL sg140_res75_a.res in I4/mcm
REM Old TITL sg140_res75 in I4/mcm
REM SHELXT solution in I4/mcm
REM R1 0.141, Rweak 0.002, Alpha 0.014, Orientation as input
REM Formula found by SHELXT: Br3 Pb
CELL 0.71073 8.3179 8.3179 11.881 90 90 90
ZERR 4 0.0004 0.0004 0.0007 0 0 0
LATT 2
SYMM -X,-Y,+Z
SYMM -Y,+X,+Z
SYMM +Y,-X,+Z
SYMM -X,+Y,0.5-Z
SYMM +X,-Y,0.5-Z
SYMM +Y,+X,0.5-Z
SYMM -Y,-X,0.5-Z
SFAC Br C N Pb
UNIT 12 4 4 4
EADP N3 C3A
EXYZ N3 C3A

L.S. 10
PLAN  1
SIZE 0.07 0.03 0.01
TEMP -98.15
list 4
fmap 2
acta
